    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2022 gross claims outstanding were GBP 200.588m. During 2022 the Syndicate recorded a significant prior-year favourable movement: a gross release of GBP 79.119m (approximately 39.5% of opening gross reserves), driven principally by favourable claims development and reinsurance recoveries. The release is reflected in the technical provisions movement and the Managing Agent commentary notes improvements on closed years (notably the 2020 year). Property exposures remain the primary line affected given the syndicate's portfolio mix and named windstorm losses in the period.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "In 2022 there has been an improvement of GBP 5.4m on closed year reserves, which makes up a significant portion of the result.",
      "The reserves set on the 2020 pure year of account at the end of last year have proved robust, and adverse claims development has been relatively small.",
      "The 2021 year of account has contributed a profit for the calendar year, before investment income, and currency exchange of GBP 19.3m. The year has benefited from prior accident year releases as well as good loss experience from attritional and large losses.",
      "Favourable movements of GBP 14.2m, (2021: GBP 30.4m), in the past year's provision for claims outstanding and IBNR, net of expected reinsurance recoveries, are included in claims incurred, net of reinsurance."
